		(property "Description" "LFXO load capacitor for Y1 (XL1/XL2). C0G/NP0 dielectric -- required for oscillator stability over temperature. Value derived, not guessed: Y1 needs CL=12.5pF, so each leg needs Ca = 2*CL = 25pF. Subtracting the NINA-B400's own XL1/XL2 pin capacitance (5pF typ, data sheet UBX-19049405 R09 Table 14 'Cpin') and ~2pF PCB stray gives 25-5-2 = 18pF external. Re-check against actual stray once the PCB stackup exists."
			(at 114.3 139.7 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "MPN" "CL10C180JB8NNNC"
			(at 114.3 139.7 0)
